{"c":[{"id":"c55d146fc1f7fbe5","sum":"Acceptance debug sockets need --test-hooks or CARET_DEBUG_SOCKET=full for all commands; otherwise state/spend only, like release (e0d39205). kit uninstall.sh leaves the dev.caret.host Metal cache under DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR (DF1 VM 20261009T044644Z-88912).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T045910Z-0e9f96548471c298","text":"Acceptance builds (build-app.sh acceptance) answer every debug-socket command only with --test-hooks or CARET_DEBUG_SOCKET=full since e0d39205; otherwise state and spend only, as a release build (DF1).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T045910Z-abba01c47d6ec6b1","text":"kit uninstall.sh leaves $(getconf DARWIN_USER_CACHE_DIR)dev.caret.host (a Metal shader cache) behind; DF1's VM run 20261009T044644Z-88912 found it after uninstall.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"f1360355f32207bc","sum":"pnpm build:store strips manifest key; store ID differs until its public key replaces extension/EXTENSION_ID. HTTP(S) grants tab title/URL without tabs. FigureView freezes rendersOffscreen; FigureIdle uses figureLife seeded/frozen, glance uses figureTyping from SurfaceCoordinator.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261009T065942Z-e248ff8cee60b01f","text":"Caret for Chrome store build (pnpm build:store) strips the manifest key, so the store ID differs from extension/EXTENSION_ID until the store's public key replaces it; tabs was dropped because the http(s) host permissions already expose tab title/url (checked in Chromium).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T082841Z-10e03653f161cdd3","text":"FigureView freezes itself when rendersOffscreen is set (Gallery.png), so references never catch a rest blink; rest beats (FigureIdle) take randomness from the figureLife environment (.seeded/.frozen) and the slip's glance direction from figureTyping, set in SurfaceCoordinator.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
